---
import LegalPage from '../../../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE, type Locale } from '../../../config/site';
import { NON_DEFAULT_LOCALES, path } from '../../../i18n/routes';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return NON_DEFAULT_LOCALES.map((locale) => ({ params: { locale } }));
}

const locale = Astro.params.locale as Locale;

const UPDATED = '2026-07-28';
const domain = SITE.url.replace(/^https?:\/\//, '');
---

<!--
  ============================================================================
  REQUIRES LEGAL REVIEW BEFORE LAUNCH.
  Written for the site as it stands: a promotional corporate site with no
  online sales, no payment and no user accounts. The moment a basket, an online
  payment or a membership appears, a distance sales contract, a pre-information
  form and return/delivery terms become mandatory and this document alone is no
  longer enough. Turkish law governs and the Turkish version is the binding one;
  the choice of forum (section 10) and any dealership claims must be checked
  against the client's actual agreements by their legal counsel.
  ============================================================================
-->
<LegalPage
  locale={locale}
  routeKey="terms"
  title="Terms of Use"
  updated={UPDATED}
  description="The terms governing use of this website: how binding the content is, that specifications may change, intellectual property, limitation of liability and governing law."
  lede={`These terms govern use of the website published at ${domain}. By continuing to use the site you accept them.`}
>
  <h2>Scope</h2>
  <p>
    The site is operated by <strong>{SITE.legal.tradeName}</strong> (“{SITE.brand.name}”). These
    terms apply to the whole of it. If you do not accept them, please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Purpose of the site</h2>
  <p>
    The site exists to present and explain what we sell. No sale is concluded on it: there is no
    online ordering, no payment is taken, and there are no user accounts.
  </p>
  <p>
    The product information published here is an <strong>invitation to treat</strong>, not a binding
    offer within the meaning of article 8 of the Turkish Code of Obligations. A request sent through
    a form is a request for information or a quotation, not an order. A sale comes into being only
    on acceptance of a written quotation and/or a contract signed by both parties.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy of content, and specifications that change</h2>
  <p>
    Technical information on this site comes from manufacturer data and our own measurements and is
    prepared to be correct on the date it is published. Even so, the specifications, configurations
    and supply conditions of machines and inks <strong>may change without notice</strong>, and the
    content may contain errors or information that has since been superseded.
  </p>
  <p>
    What binds us is the specification set out in the written quotation and order confirmation given
    to you. Published print speeds are figures measured at a stated pass count on a stated material
    under stated conditions; real production speed depends on the file, the substrate, the pass
    count and the working environment. Outdoor durability figures depend on climate and exposure. No
    prices are published on the site; prices depend on configuration and are given by quotation.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property and third-party marks</h2>
  <p>
    All content on the site — text, images, technical drawings, three-dimensional models, design,
    layout and software — belongs to {SITE.brand.name} or to the respective rights holders and is
    protected under Law no. 5846 on Intellectual and Artistic Works and related legislation.
    Copying, reproducing, adapting, distributing or commercially exploiting the content in whole or
    in part without permission is prohibited. The right to short quotation with attribution is
    reserved.
  </p>
  <p>
    Third-party brand, model and technology names appearing on the site are used solely for
    identification and compatibility purposes and belong to their respective owners. Such use does
    not imply any partnership, endorsement or authorisation; distributorship and authorised-dealer
    relationships apply only where the site states them expressly, and only to the extent stated.
  </p>

  <h2>Rules for using the site</h2>
  <p>When using the site you must not:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>do anything that damages the site, its infrastructure or its security, or that disrupts the service;</li>
    <li>harvest or copy the content in bulk by automated means, or republish it elsewhere;</li>
    <li>carry out unauthorised security testing, attempt unauthorised access or transmit malicious code;</li>
    <li>complete the forms with false, misleading or other people’s information.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Linked sites</h2>
  <p>
    The site may link to third-party websites. {SITE.brand.name} is not responsible for their
    content, their privacy and cookie practices or the services they provide. A link does not mean
    the site or its content is endorsed.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    We do not warrant that the site will be uninterrupted, error-free or always available; access
    may pause temporarily for maintenance, technical failure or reasons originating with the
    hosting provider.
  </p>
  <p>
    Save for mandatory provisions of law, {SITE.brand.name} is not liable for decisions taken in
    reliance on information published here, nor for indirect damage, loss of profit or loss of
    production arising from use of, or inability to use, the site. Before committing to a machine or
    a consumable we recommend confirming its fitness for your work with a demo print on your own
    material and a written quotation. Liability for intent and gross negligence is reserved in all
    cases under article 115 of the Turkish Code of Obligations.
  </p>

  <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    How personal data submitted through the forms is processed is set out in the
    <a class="link link--inline" href={path('privacy', locale)}>Privacy Notice</a>; what the site
    does and does not store in your browser is set out in the
    <a class="link link--inline" href={path('cookies', locale)}>Cookie Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    These terms may be amended without prior notice. Amendments take effect when published on the
    site, and the date at the top of this page is the date of the last revision. Continued use of
    the site means you accept the terms then in force.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law and jurisdiction</h2>
  <p>
    These terms and the use of the site are governed by Turkish law. The courts and enforcement
    offices of {SITE.contact.address.city} have jurisdiction over any dispute. For persons acting as
    consumers, the mandatory provisions on the jurisdiction of consumer arbitration committees and
    consumer courts are reserved.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
